---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="What's the Enrollment Process? | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn about Marietta Childcare's enrollment process, required documents, timeline, and orientation procedures.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/parent_dropoff_hug_doorway_background.jpg" 
        alt="Enrollment process" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">What's the Enrollment Process?</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Steps to enroll, required documents, timeline, and orientation procedures for new families.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">What's the Enrollment Process at Marietta Childcare?</h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare's enrollment process is designed to be straightforward and family-friendly. Marietta Childcare guides families through each step to ensure a smooth transition into quality childcare.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Initial Inquiry and Center Tour</h2>
          <p>The enrollment process at Marietta Childcare begins with an initial inquiry. Families interested in Marietta Childcare should contact the center to schedule a tour. During the tour at Marietta Childcare, families meet staff, observe classrooms, and learn about the curriculum and daily operations.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's tour provides families with firsthand experience of the learning environment. The tour at Marietta Childcare allows parents to ask questions about programs, safety protocols, and educational philosophy. Marietta Childcare's staff answers all parent questions during the tour to help families make informed decisions.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Enrollment Application</h2>
          <p>After the tour, families complete an enrollment application at Marietta Childcare. The enrollment application at Marietta Childcare collects essential information about the child and family. Marietta Childcare's application process includes questions about the child's age, developmental history, and any special needs or allergies.</p>
          <p>Families provide contact information and emergency contacts during the enrollment application at Marietta Childcare. The application at Marietta Childcare also includes authorization for field trips, photography, and emergency medical care.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Required Documentation</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare requires specific documentation to complete enrollment. Required documents for enrollment at Marietta Childcare include the child's birth certificate and proof of immunizations. Marietta Childcare maintains immunization records to ensure compliance with Georgia childcare licensing requirements.</p>
          <p>For GA Pre-K enrollment at Marietta Childcare, families must provide the child's birth certificate, social security card, and proof of Georgia residency. GA Pre-K enrollment at Marietta Childcare may also require an immunization record and Form 3300, depending on the specific school's requirements. Families should check with the Marietta center director about additional documentation needed for GA Pre-K enrollment.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Registration and Fees</h2>
          <p>Upon approval, families pay registration fees at Marietta Childcare to secure their child's enrollment. Registration fees at Marietta Childcare vary by program type and age group. Marietta Childcare's registration fee holds the child's spot in the class.</p>
          <p>Families discuss payment options during the enrollment process at Marietta Childcare. Marietta Childcare accepts weekly and monthly payment plans. Financial assistance options are discussed during enrollment at Marietta Childcare for families who qualify for subsidies or tuition assistance programs.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Orientation and Start Date</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare schedules an orientation before the child's start date. The orientation at Marietta Childcare familiarizes families with daily routines, drop-off and pickup procedures, and communication methods. Marietta Childcare's orientation covers classroom policies, meal times, and rest schedules.</p>
          <p>During orientation at Marietta Childcare, families receive information about the curriculum and developmental activities. Marietta Childcare's orientation introduces families to the child's classroom teacher and support staff. The orientation at Marietta Childcare allows families to ask questions about the transition process.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Transition Timeline</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare recommends a gradual transition for children starting at the center. The transition timeline at Marietta Childcare typically spans one to two weeks. During the transition at Marietta Childcare, children attend for progressively longer periods to adjust to the new environment.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's transition approach supports children's emotional adjustment. The transition at Marietta Childcare includes parent communication about the child's adjustment progress. Marietta Childcare's staff works with families to customize the transition timeline based on the individual child's needs.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Waiting List and Availability</h2>
          <p>Availability varies by location and age group at Marietta Childcare. Families interested in enrollment at Marietta Childcare should inquire about current availability. If spaces are not immediately available, Marietta Childcare maintains a waiting list.</p>
          <p>Families on the waiting list at Marietta Childcare are contacted when spaces become available. The enrollment team at Marietta Childcare provides regular updates to families on the waiting list. Marietta Childcare's director can provide the most up-to-date information about availability at the Marietta location.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Expected Start Date Planning</h2>
          <p>Families work with Marietta Childcare's enrollment team to establish an expected start date. The expected start date at Marietta Childcare is confirmed after all documentation is submitted and registration fees are paid. Marietta Childcare provides families with a written confirmation of the start date.</p>
          <p>Families can adjust the expected start date at Marietta Childcare if circumstances change. Marietta Childcare's enrollment advisors work with families to find start dates that align with family schedules and needs.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Begin Your Enrollment Journey</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare welcomes families to start the enrollment process. Contact Marietta Childcare today to schedule a tour and learn more about how Marietta Childcare can support your child's development and your family's needs.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/faq/how-much-childcare-cost" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Much Does Childcare Cost?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/transition-to-kindergarten" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Do You Prepare for Kindergarten?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">About Marietta Childcare</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Us</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
